<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/19/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Administration of Islamic Law (Federal Territories) Act 1993 [Act 505], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in section 2 by deleting the definition of “Peguam Syarie”. Deletion of section 59"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/19/eng@> .
